# The platform folders (android/, ios/, macos/, windows/, linux/, web/) are
# INTENTIONALLY NOT ignored — commit them once generated + customized per
# README.md "Setup" / packaging/*, since the GitHub Actions workflow in
# .github/workflows/build.yml builds directly from whatever's committed
# rather than regenerating them (which would wipe your manifest/plist edits
# on every run).

